<title>FRANCE: Eurotunnel opens higher after debt plan.</title>
<headline>Eurotunnel opens higher after debt plan.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Channel Tunnel operator Eurotunnel SA /Plc opened 8.07 percent higher at 8.70 francs on Friday after shareholders approved a debt restructuring plan for the company on Thursday.</p>
<p>The company's shares were suspended all day on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
